---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/pages/contact.css';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="聯絡我們 — NCU BoltNut Robotics"
  description="聯絡 NCU BoltNut Robotics — Facebook、Instagram、Threads 社群媒體，以及贊助夥伴資訊。"
  navActive="contact"
>
  <section class="page-header fade-up">
    <span class="eyebrow">Get in Touch</span>
    <h1>聯絡我們 / CONTACT</h1>
    <p>關注我們的社群，獲取最新競賽動態與活動消息</p>
  </section>

  <section class="social-section fade-up-1">
    <div class="section-head" style="margin-bottom:32px;">
      <span class="eyebrow">Follow Us</span>
      <h2>社群媒體</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="social-grid">
      <a href="https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61574963106735" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="social-cell">
        <span class="social-badge round"><span>f</span></span>
        <span class="social-platform">Facebook</span>
        <span class="social-handle">NCU BoltNut Robotics →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://www.threads.com/@ncu_boltnut_robotics" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="social-cell">
        <span class="social-badge round"><span>@</span></span>
        <span class="social-platform">Threads</span>
        <span class="social-handle">@ncu_boltnut_robotics →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://www.instagram.com/ncu_boltnut_robotics/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="social-cell">
        <span class="social-badge rounded"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="17.2" cy="6.8" r="1.1" fill="#fff"/></svg></span>
        <span class="social-platform">Instagram</span>
        <span class="social-handle">@ncu_boltnut_robotics →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="mailto:ncuboltnutrobotics@gmail.com" class="social-cell">
        <span class="social-badge square"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M4 7l8 6 8-6" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"/></svg></span>
        <span class="social-platform">Email</span>
        <span class="social-handle" style="word-break:break-all;">ncuboltnutrobotics@gmail.com →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="join-cta fade-up-3">
    <h2>對機器人有熱情？歡迎加入 BoltNut！</h2>
    <p>無論你擅長機械設計、程式控制還是行政企劃，只要有熱情，BoltNut 都歡迎你一起 Bolt together。</p>
    <a href="https://www.instagram.com/ncu_boltnut_robotics/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-orange">追蹤 Instagram 了解招募資訊 →</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
